# Optional SDK features enabled by the shared software preset.
# Named configurations may override these boolean choices. Keep hardware,
# backend selection, memory geometry and provisioning in their existing files.
# Every key listed here (and in a board preset) is reconciled on every
# tools/build_board.sh build, plain board builds included: a value changed with
# menuconfig in that build's sdkconfig is reset to the preset before Kconfig
# runs. To build with a different value, save it as an SDK choice in a named
# configuration (configurations/README.md).
CONFIG_BT_ENABLED=y
